      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "海关里高大的由加利树和一片柔软的绿草，构成了主要的景致。",
      "output_sha256": "b6791a18a97a6dc9472e19d6dddd4c5498223bc9c7b421a34dac7b5284f1bc96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.545287,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d648051caebe0c148b3f057557294b5f459e0bf59afbce6eb34e56f923f4dd31"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b6791a18a97a6dc9472e19d6dddd4c5498223bc9c7b421a34dac7b5284f1bc96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "走进门来，胸怀顿时开阔，浑身也感到一种润泽。",
      "output_sha256": "22a05ea9fcf57f586ed060b42e311d9df46898c28f275611a8a53c562d92d96f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.545287,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d648051caebe0c148b3f057557294b5f459e0bf59afbce6eb34e56f923f4dd31"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "22a05ea9fcf57f586ed060b42e311d9df46898c28f275611a8a53c562d92d96f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "树头上好些白鹭，和北平太庙里的“灰鹤”是一类，北方叫做“老等”。",
      "output_sha256": "726392dbca1ed7b43920789917492eea26f0fae1d5a5753d94b6a5ac7ac71f5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "726392dbca1ed7b43920789917492eea26f0fae1d5a5753d94b6a5ac7ac71f5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那洁白的羽毛和灵动的姿态，令人陶醉，清晨时分尤为迷人。",
      "output_sha256": "a6423f0a2634618dac66d63b1a94940f848962e03d2ec7bcc9edf995f053fea8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.498333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "044da7fce32ccbfbb7944a17c663b57ea3599a39440e7af969295ab7c52e590a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6423f0a2634618dac66d63b1a94940f848962e03d2ec7bcc9edf995f053fea8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在一个角落里有一条灌木林的甬道，夜里月光从叶缝里筛下来，该是顶有趣的。",
      "output_sha256": "923e60e127d4ab661f1a380e0120b64b5ccf74cea426316067e8f0c2cb97a42d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "923e60e127d4ab661f1a380e0120b64b5ccf74cea426316067e8f0c2cb97a42d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "另一个角落长着些芒果树和木瓜树，可惜太阳力量不够，果实结得不肥，但沾着点热带味，也叫人高兴。",
      "output_sha256": "6b4ce3ee2f7d4161364bbddb1fd8ab651ff96f471401a0980a4bda85dbbe330c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "6b4ce3ee2f7d4161364bbddb1fd8ab651ff96f471401a0980a4bda85dbbe330c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "银行里花卉繁多，色彩斑斓，始终让人不觉寂寞。",
      "output_sha256": "544f219b21fada8cd6b195241869d394d7636e647556779f04c162bcd7e937dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": 0.468947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d6a98921a87fd62fca698a825e94955a779870d79b61166fadd3332f0774e830"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_ai_sha256": "544f219b21fada8cd6b195241869d394d7636e647556779f04c162bcd7e937dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "最艳丽的要数叶子花。",
      "output_sha256": "2da1e6378c5dce58cdace8c6f8d5e4e8937eafaf98551ba907b18d783f81b7a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "2da1e6378c5dce58cdace8c6f8d5e4e8937eafaf98551ba907b18d783f81b7a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "花是浊浓的紫，脉络分明活像叶，一丛丛的，一片片的，真是“浓得化不开”。",
      "output_sha256": "62f7b3486fd20d22510d3703903af3a62c355cdbf23af0b5c391dd66b963a61b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "62f7b3486fd20d22510d3703903af3a62c355cdbf23af0b5c391dd66b963a61b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "花开的时候真久。",
      "output_sha256": "c67fad2dc5f08bddb4a0a2de56caf66f043879895650e54d9676926840bafb17",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "c67fad2dc5f08bddb4a0a2de56caf66f043879895650e54d9676926840bafb17",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们四月里去，它就开了，八月里走，它还没谢呢。",
      "output_sha256": "5a5bc378a1b9bdfbf2126875b8719236bb9f47ead7312a99ad3b366448324af5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
